<mxfile host="Electron">
  <diagram id="produksierd" name="Modul Produksi ERD">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1178" dy="801" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="3000" pageHeight="1900" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
<mxCell id="title1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;fontSize=16;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="Modul Produksi ERD (PK/FK + representative business columns, grouped by Module) -- Report Produksi reconciled with client Rev 2 on 2026-09-24" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="10" width="1800" height="20" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="note1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=2;fontSize=11;fontColor=#666666;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="Rebuilt 2026-09-22 to reconcile with the client&#x27;s own revised ERD (input/Rev.1 erd.drawio produksi.drawio) and the updated fr-nfr.md/workbook.xlsx. Report Produksi / HPP replaced 2026-09-24 by the client&#x27;s Rev 2 ERD (input/Rev 2 Production Report.drawio, confirmed to replace the Rev.1 report_produksi and hpp): 4 tables, production_reports (header, incl. total_hpp_keseluruhan) 1 : many production_report_materials / production_report_items (cost components + total_hpp_item) / production_report_scraps via production_report_id, column names verbatim from Rev 2. FK markers on id_tr_spk_detail, id_asset_machine, id_unpack_baby_coil and product_lvl_4_id are drawn from relationships already on this ERD (Rev 2 does not mark them FK). employee_helper/employee_setter reference employee, id_asset_machine references asset (confirmed 2026-09-24). Rev 2 has no warehouse-stock-coil link, so the former wsc relationship was dropped. jurnal_produksi.HPP_Id will reference the future Report HPP (not yet drawn); Sisa Coil / Hold Coil will live in a future warehouse_stock table, distinguished by warehouse id (not yet drawn). Reconciled with Rev 2 on 2026-09-24. Earlier sections: Naming split: entities/columns carried over unchanged from the prior diagram (Unpack, Gudang Produksi 2, Report Produksi&#x27;s legacy tables, Report HPP&#x27;s Jurnal/GL) keep the project&#x27;s older &#x27;_Id&#x27; PK/FK suffix; production_reports (and its detail tables), employee, asset and production_plan use the client file&#x27;s own &#x27;id_&#x27; FK prefix verbatim, incl. FKs on legacy tables that now point at these new entities (e.g. id_employee). This split is intentional, not yet unified -- flagged, not resolved. production_plan (tr_spk_material_header/tr_spk_material_detail) is external/read-only -- Modul Produksi does not create or edit this data, it only reads id_tr_spk_detail for traceability (FR-25/NFR-02); shown with a grey fill to mark it as an external dependency, same convention Product Costing used previously (undrawn) but this entity is explicitly asked for in the workbook so it is drawn instead. asset.nm_asset / asset.nm_category are marked FK in the client source with no drawn target table (open question in fr-nfr.md) -- left dangling here, not guessed. (The duplicated hpp Sisa Coil row-groups no longer exist after Rev 2.) Baby_Coil origin remains polymorphic (FR-08); production_report_materials.id_unpack_baby_coil is the link from the report." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="30" width="2200" height="160" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
